services/flink-job/corpus/

# Spec 004 measurement harnesses. Throwaway by design, like phase0/ beside
# them, and they hold captured Kafka slices -- phase5/ alone is ~63 MB, most
# of it one post-cutover.jsonl. Both directories describe themselves as
# untracked; this is what makes that true, so one `git add -A` cannot commit
# a large blob into history permanently.
services/stream-monitoring/phase0/
services/stream-monitoring/phase5/

# Agent-created git worktrees (full duplicate checkouts)
.claude/worktrees/
